  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "nasa-sdo-surya-bench",
  "description": "Machine learning (ML)-ready solar dataset curated from NASA Solar Dynamics Observatory (SDO) observations (May 13, 2010 \u2013 December 31, 2024). Contains Level-1.5 full-disk 4096x4096 multi-wavelength imagery from the Atmospheric Imaging Assembly (AIA) across 8 EUV channels and magnetic field / Doppler velocity measurements from the Helioseismic and Magnetic Imager (HMI) across 5 channels at 12-minute cadence.",
